{
  "id": "https://geo-carto.github.io/vocabularios/contacto-tipo/contacto",
  "type": "Concept",
  "prefLabel": {
    "en": "contact",
    "es": "contacto"
  },
  "definition": {
    "en": "A surface that separates geologic units. Very general concept representing any kind of surface separating two geologic units, including primary boundaries such as depositional contacts, all kinds of unconformities, intrusive contacts, and gradational contacts, as well as faults that separate geologic units.",
    "es": "Una superficie que separa unidades geológicas. Concepto muy general que representa cualquier tipo de superficie que separa dos unidades geológicas, incluyendo límites primarios como contactos deposicionales, discordancias, contactos intrusivos y contactos gradacionales, así como todo tipo de fallas."
  },
